WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.333
Smart contracts aren't smart. And they're not really contracts.

2
00:00:08.333 --> 00:00:14.000
Most people think it's an automated legal agreement that thinks.

3
00:00:14.167 --> 00:00:18.000
It has nothing to do with law or intelligence.

4
00:00:19.333 --> 00:00:25.000
It's just code on a blockchain that runs when conditions are met.

5
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:41.000
IF payment received → THEN the asset transfers. Automatically.

6
00:00:41.333 --> 00:00:47.333
No lawyers. No banks. No middlemen. Just code running trustlessly.

7
00:00:53.333 --> 00:00:58.667
Once deployed on the blockchain, no one can change or stop it.

8
00:00:58.833 --> 00:01:04.000
Every DeFi protocol, every NFT market is built on smart contracts.

9
00:01:04.333 --> 00:01:08.667
Start building in Web3 at 0xverse Academy.

